plan "Cedar Ridge (composed)"
envelope 48 x 30
ceiling 10

# --- proven, reusable blocks (see parts/) -------------------------------------
# Each `use` stamps a transformed copy of a part into the plan; its ids become
# <alias>.<id> (m.bed, k.kitchen, b1.bath). Host statements reference the stamped
# ids exactly like local ones — `door great - m.bed`, `door dining - k.kitchen`.
# The master's bath is an interior core (mechanical vent) and its bedroom opens to
# the great room in this open plan — both accepted, audited deviations.
# barndsl: accept BATH_VENT "interior bath core — mechanical ventilation"
# barndsl: accept BED_PRIVACY "open-plan suite off the great room"
use "parts/master_suite.barn" as m  at 0,0
use "parts/kitchen_l.barn"    as k  at 26,18
# `mirror y` reflects the bath core east↔west (Phase 7b): its window offset
# re-derives to the same exterior wall while the interior fixture layout flips —
# the dual-orientation motif a mirror-image pair of cores is built from.
use "parts/bath_core.barn"    as b1 at 40,0 mirror y
use "parts/laundry_core.barn" as lc at 40,6

# --- the host's own rooms -----------------------------------------------------
room great: living at 0,13 size 22 x 17
room hall: hallway at 22,0 size 4 x 30   # barndsl: accept HALL_DEADEND "spine reaches the north entry"
room dining: dining at 26,0 size 14 x 18
# An 8 x 9 office (1.1:1 — a desk room, not a corridor with a desk) with the
# leftover east-column run given to a utility room capping the service stack
# (bath, laundry, utility) instead of stretching the office to 2.1:1.
room office: office at 40,13 size 8 x 9
room store: utility at 40,22 size 8 x 8

# --- host circulation reaches into the stamped parts by their namespaced ids --
door great - m.bed width 3 offset 2 into m.bed hinge near
door great - hall cased width 6
door hall - m.bath width 2.5 into m.bath hinge near   # a private hall door to the suite
door hall - dining cased width 6
door dining - k.kitchen cased width 8
door dining - b1.bath width 2.5 into b1.bath hinge near
door dining - lc.laundry width 2.5 offset 1 into lc.laundry hinge near
door dining - office width 3
door office - store width 2.5 offset 0.5

# --- the building entrances (people doors) + their landings -------------------
entry great west width 3 offset 6
entry hall north width 3 offset 0.5
porch stoop_w at -4,18 size 4 x 4 covered
porch stoop_n at 22,30 size 4 x 4 covered

# --- daylight the habitable host rooms + safety glazing near doors ------------
window great north width 8 offset 7 tempered
window great west width 5 offset 11 tempered
window dining south width 7 offset 4
window office east width 5 offset 2

# --- life safety: a smoke alarm outside the sleeping area (IRC R314) -----------
alarm smoke in great
